[[File:Star_Commuter_Ambassador_Shuttle.png|thumb|right|250px|A Star Commuter 2000 passenger shuttle]]
'''Passenger shuttles''' were a type of [[shuttle]] specifically designed to ferry passengers between locations. The [[Star Commuter 2000]] was a model of passenger shuttle<ref name="SWE CGSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> manufactured by the [[Sacul Industries]] for short trips between planets.<ref name="FB">{{Facebook|username=starwarsrebels|url=starwarsrebels/photos/pb.180356405454324.-2207520000.1414501247./367182126771750|name=''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''|date=2014-10-16|quote=Piloted by RX-series droids, Star Commuter 2000's are used for travel between nearby planets.|archivedate=20151231223354}}</ref>

